[sop_kotlin_06] Kotlin - SOP: Langkah 4: Pengujian Fitur Modern Kotlin 2.0 (Smart Casts & Data Objects)
Dokumen: Standar Operasional Prosedur (SOP): Setup dan Konfigurasi Lingkungan Pemrograman Kotlin (Kotlin 2.0+ & Gradle)
Kategori: SOP Setup & Environment
Sumber: knowledge-base/sop-setup-environment-kotlin.md

1. Buka atau buat berkas `app/src/main/kotlin/com/example/app/App.kt`:
   ```kotlin
   package com.example.app

   // Uji Data Object Kotlin modern
   sealed interface AppState {
       data object Initializing : AppState
       data class Running(val version: String) : AppState
   }

   fun evaluateState(state: AppState): String {
       // Uji exhaustive when dan Smart Cast 2.0
       return when (state) {
           is AppState.Initializing => "Memulai inisialisasi lingkungan..."
           is AppState.Running => "Status: Kotlin ${state.version} K2 Compiler aktif dan terverifikasi."
       }
   }

   fun main() {
       val state: AppState = AppState.Running(KotlinVersion.CURRENT.toString())
       println(evaluateState(state))
   }
   ```
2. Jalankan kompilasi dan aplikasi via Gradle:
   ```bash
   ./gradlew run
   ```
   *(Pada Windows: `gradlew.bat run`).*

[sop_php_06] PHP - SOP: Langkah 4: Inisialisasi Proyek dan Pengujian Sintaks Modern PHP
Dokumen: Standar Operasional Prosedur (SOP): Setup dan Konfigurasi Lingkungan Pemrograman PHP (PHP 8.2 / 8.3 / 8.4 & Composer)
Kategori: SOP Setup & Environment
Sumber: knowledge-base/sop-setup-environment-php.md

1. Buat folder proyek dan inisialisasi:
   ```bash
   mkdir my-php-project
   cd my-php-project
   composer init --no-interaction
   ```
2. Buat berkas uji `verify_setup.php` untuk memvalidasi fitur modern (Readonly Class, Match Expression, dan Enums):
   ```php
   <?php
   // Uji Enum bawaan PHP 8.1+
   enum EnvironmentStatus: string {
       case Ready = "READY";
       case Failed = "FAILED";
   }

   // Uji Readonly Class PHP 8.2+
   readonly class SystemChecker {
       public function __construct(
           public string $phpVersion,
           public EnvironmentStatus $status
       ) {}

       public function evaluate(): string {
           return match($this->status) {
               EnvironmentStatus::Ready => "Sukses: PHP {$this->phpVersion} siap digunakan.",
               EnvironmentStatus::Failed => "Galat: Konfigurasi PHP bermasalah."
           };
       }
   }

   $checker = new SystemChecker(phpversion(), EnvironmentStatus::Ready);
   echo $checker->evaluate() . PHP_EOL;
   ```
3. Eksekusi skrip melalui terminal:
   ```bash
   php verify_setup.php
   ```

