}
export default myStrictFunction;
### Strict mode for classes
All parts of a [class](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Classes)'s body are strict mode code, including both [class
declarations](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Statements/class) and [class
expressions](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/class).
