## Examples
### Avoiding control flow statements
You can avoid almost all use of control flow statements using expression statements. For example, `if...else` can be replaced
with [ternary operators](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Conditional_operator) and [logical
operators](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators#binary_logical_operators). Iterative statements like `for` or
