The **`switch`** statement evaluates an [expression](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Expressions_and_operators),
matching the expression's value against a series of `case` clauses, and executes
[statements](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Statements) after the first `case` clause with a matching value, until a
