- `try...catch`
- `try...finally`
- `try...catch...finally`
Unlike other constructs such as [`if`](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Statements/if...else) or
[`for`](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Statements/for), the `try`, `catch`, and `finally` blocks must be _blocks_, instead
of single statements.
