On the other hand, spreading in [object literals](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Object_initializer)
[enumerates](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Enumerability_and_ownership_of_properties#traversing_object_properties)
the own properties of the value. For typical arrays, all indices are enumerable own properties, so arrays can be spread into
objects.
