Unary negation (-)
Sumber: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Unary_negation
The **unary negation (`-`)** operator precedes its operand and negates it.
JavaScript Demo: Unary negation (-) operator
