### Parameters
- `object`
  - : An object that implements the [iterable](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Iteration_protocols#the_iterable_protocol)
protocol or the [iterator](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Iteration_protocols#the_iterator_protocol) protocol.
