### Parameters
- `value`
  - : Numeric value to use in the internationalized relative time message.
- `unit`
  - : Unit to use in the relative time internationalized message. Possible values are: `"year"`, `"quarter"`, `"month"`, `"week"`,
`"day"`, `"hour"`, `"minute"`, `"second"`. Plural forms are also permitted.
### Return value
A string representing the given `value` and `unit` formatted according to the locale and formatting options of this
