{{jsxref("Temporal/ZonedDateTime/toLocaleString", "Temporal.ZonedDateTime.prototype.toLocaleString()")}} or convert it to a
Temporal.PlainDateTime object instead.
- `endDate`
  - : The end of the date range. Must have the same type as `startDate`.
### Return value
An Array of objects containing the formatted date range in parts. Each object has three properties, `type`, `value`, and
`source`, each containing a string. The string concatenation of `value`, in the order provided, will result in the same string as
{{jsxref("Intl/DateTimeFormat/formatRange", "formatRange()")}}. The `type` may have the same values as
