The **`constructor`** method is a special method of a [class](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Classes) for creating
and initializing an object instance of that class.
> [!NOTE]
> This page introduces the `constructor` syntax. For the `constructor` property present on all objects, see
Object.prototype.constructor.
