management system to do resource management, as a last resort. For example, if you have a JavaScript object representing
a handle of an external resource, you can create a FinalizationRegistry to clean up the resource when the handle is garbage
collected, because there is definitely no way to access the resource afterwards. However, there is no guarantee that the
finalizer will run, so it's not a good idea to rely on it for critical resources.
